  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Doctrine and Covenants",
    "delineation": "Section",
    "number": 100,
    "summary": "1–4, Joseph and Sidney to preach the gospel for the salvation of souls; 5–8, It will be given them in the very hour what they should say; 9–12, Sidney is to be a spokesman and Joseph is to be a revelator and mighty in testimony; 13–17, The Lord will raise up a pure people, and the obedient will be saved.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given to Joseph Smith the Prophet and Sidney Rigdon, at Perrysburg, New York, October 12, 1833. The two brethren, having been absent from their families for several days, felt some concern about them."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Verily, thus saith the Lord unto you, my friends Sidney and Joseph, your families are well; they are in mine hands, and I will do with them as seemeth me good; for in me there is all power.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 104,
            "end": 114,
            "text": "TG Protection, Divine."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Protection, Divine.",
            "prettyString": "TG Protection, Divine",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Protection, Divine",
                "entryId": "tg-protection-divine",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Doctrine and Covenants 100:1",
        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 100,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, follow me, and listen to the counsel which I shall give unto you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Doctrine and Covenants 100:2",
        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 100,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, and lo, I have much people in this place, in the regions round about; and an effectual door shall be opened in the regions round about in this eastern land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Doctrine and Covenants 100:3",
        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 100,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, I, the Lord, have suffered you to come unto this place; for thus it was expedient in me for the salvation of souls.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 107,
            "end": 116,
            "text": "TG Mission of Latter-day Saints."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Mission of Latter-day Saints.",
            "prettyString": "TG Mission of Latter-day Saints",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Mission of Latter-day Saints",
                "entryId": "tg-mission-of-latter-day-saints",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Doctrine and Covenants 100:4",
        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 100,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, verily I say unto you, lift up your voices unto this people; speak the thoughts that I shall put into your hearts, and you shall not be confounded before men;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 77,
            "text": "Ex. 4:12 (12–16); Prov. 16:1; Hel. 5:18 (18–19); 13:3; D&C 68:3 (3–4)."
          },
          {
            "start": 147,
            "end": 157,
            "text": "Acts 6:10."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Acts 6:10.",
            "prettyString": "Acts 6:10",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "acts",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 6,
                    "end": 6,
                    "verses": [
                      {
